<title>USA: Dow Jones stake held by Franklin Resources.</title>
<headline>Dow Jones stake held by Franklin Resources.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Franklin Resources Inc on Monday said it held a 5.4 percent stake in Dow Jones &amp; Co, or 4,051,100 common shares.  </p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its latest transactions included a net 4,049,100 shares purchased between January 7 and January 30 at prices ranging from $33.9432 to $40.75 each.</p>
<p>The group holds the stake for investment purposes, the filing said.</p>
</text>
